  writers usp_updateLetterAfterSave / PRC_STL_GenLetter_ADD_V2)
  NOT EXECUTED by the author. Every query in this file is READ-ONLY.
  The original-vs-new result comparison is a client script
  (v3_01_harness.ps1): T-SQL cannot capture this procedure's result set,
  because the procedure itself uses INSERT ... EXEC (error 8164 if nested).

  Order:
    1. Production (read-only): V3-00, V3-01.1, V3-01.2, V3-01.3 (before).
    2. UAT: deploy sp/PRC_Standard_Letter_KeyValues_V1.sql, run
       v3_01_harness_orig_copy.sql, then v3_01_harness.ps1; V3-01.0.
